    "directions": [
      "Using a vegetable peeler, remove 1 strip of orange zest, 1 strip of lime zest, and 1 strip of lemon zest and set aside. Juice the oranges, limes, and lemon. Combined you should have 1-1/4 to 1-1/2 cups of juice.",
      "Place the juices and zests, the wine, cinnamon, garlic, ginger, and pepper in a heavy nonreactive saucepan and bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce the heat to medium and simmer, uncovered, until the mixture is reduced to 1 cup, about 10 minutes.",
      "Remove the pan from the heat and cool to room temperature. Stir in the onion, paprika, sugar, salt, red pepper flakes, nutmeg, and oil. Use within a few hours of making."
    ],
